  <item>
    <title>VOL 2. 新加坡[24]小时旅游攻略[2024版]</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66758513b6a841272969b834</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66758513b6a841272969b834</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Jun 2024 13:50:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>朋友们好！走心胡逼的新一期节目上线了。高考结束了，暑假也即将来临，相信不少朋友开始规划夏日旅行计划！年初新加坡对中国的免签相信也让这个南洋小国成为大家出国旅行的一个选择。本期Medium和清流打算趁这个机会，给大家做一个24小时的新加坡旅行攻略！不仅囊括了所有值得游玩的地方，更梳理了这里最受欢迎的食物供大家体验。我们希望大家能够时间较为紧张的情况下在新加坡依然吃好喝好玩好！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期导航：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a>：开头吹水部分，以及为什么要做这一期节目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="309">05:09</a>：当前新加坡的入境规则和流程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a>：第一站！我们建议你先去机场转转，以及几点落地新加坡合适？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="836">13:56</a>：早上起太早可能啥都玩不到，但是可以吃到传统早餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="893">14:53</a>：第二站！最出名的鱼尾狮公园！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a>：第三站！柯南炸了两次的金沙酒店没有你想象的那么小</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1343">22:23</a>：第四站！杀手47在滨海湾花园也得捡子弹壳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1687">28:07</a>：第五站！新加坡的唐人街居然叫“牛车水”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a>：第六站！最出片的马来文化街“哈芝巷”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2013">33:33</a>：第七站！在“小印度”你可以吃到最正宗的“英国咖喱” &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2137">35:37</a>：Medium私藏的拍照圣地！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2224">37:04</a>：第八站！彩虹警察局对面就是好吃的肉骨茶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">38:40</a>：听我们一劝，新加坡的海鲜并不好吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2536">42:16</a>：第九站！上圣淘沙岛啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2752">45:52</a>：新加坡环球影城真的很小！但是依然有很多值得玩的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3048">50:48</a>：水族馆很适合拍照哦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3093">51:33</a>：Taylor同款度假村，你心动了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3141">52:21</a>：可以随便转转的一系列打卡地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="208464">57:54:24</a>小时特种兵行程大梳理！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3760">62:40</a>：干饭！从早餐开始！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3791">63:11</a>：闻名已久的“海南鸡饭”有什么魅力？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3812">63:32</a>：再给你介绍一下马来美食椰浆饭！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3878">64:38</a>：新加坡“必吃榜”之肉骨茶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3912">65:12</a>：新加坡著名的“食阁”文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4003">66:43</a>：辣椒蟹和炸馒头更般配哦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4095">68:15</a>：新加坡的甜点从榴莲开始吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4233">70:33</a>：南洋咖啡好喝在哪里？点咖啡都有它的独到之处哦～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4379">72:59</a>：总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4538">75:38</a>：惊喜花絮</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期歌单来自澳大利亚摇滚乐队 [5 Seconds of Summer]</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：四季ノ呗 — MINMI</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgk8jtxmSbOcO33Ar8hsg4jqlfS-.m4a" length="113257873" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:02</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg7BrmuxgYTCz4qRu5ZUa88Q7qtY.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
