  <item>
    <title>VOL 1. 新加坡的大专可以当高中读? (Part 2)</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665094a44efbc0c3dcd5236b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665094a44efbc0c3dcd5236b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 24 May 2024 13:22:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>朋友们好！走心胡逼第一期的第二部分来啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>上一期我们聊到了新加坡的初中教育，所以这一期我们来到了新加坡的高中，但这个高中怎么听起来和Medium上的高中不一样呢？一起来听听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期导航：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a> 上期总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 新加坡理工学院是什么样的？怎么毕业的时候去垃圾焚烧厂实习了六个月？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1009">16:49</a> 理工学院的硬核考试与大学升学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1987">33:07</a> 理工学院毕业就业怎么样？为什么喜欢第一学期第一周每天去食堂？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2823">47:03</a> 出国留学多年，依然哑巴英语？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期歌单均来自日本四重奏乐队Mime，具体曲目如下：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Put your gun down》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《I Just Wanna Say》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Seed》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Enigma》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Starchild》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Labyrinth》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Colorful Raindrop》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《You Are Beautiful》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《エメラルドグリ-ンの摇らめき》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Caught in Shower》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Sunflower》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Bubble》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Upside Down》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《夢見心地 feat.maco marets》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Headlight》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Distance》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Driftin'》</span></p>]]></description>
