    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>走心胡逼的第一期终于来了！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这一期中，Medium将和他在新加坡的好朋友清流一起，聊一聊新加坡的初中生活！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期导引：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">02:11</a> 清流为什么选择去新加坡读初中？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a> 刚到新加坡，清流都遇到什么不适应的？新加坡的初中都上什么课？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 新加坡的初中生活怎么样？初中学制是怎么样的？如何升学？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2900">48:20</a> 丰富的课外活动（CCA）是什么样的？ 中新两国初中对比！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3660">61:00</a> 结语</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期歌单均来自加拿大迷幻摇滚乐队Meltt，具体歌名如下：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 《Into the Blue》</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 《Only in Your Eyes》</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. 《Within You, Within Me》</span></p><span></span><p><span>4. 《Do You Ever Wonder?》</span></p><span></span><p><span>5. 《The Absent Sea》</span></p><span></span><p><span>6. 《It Could Grow Anywhere》</span></p><span></span><p><span>7. 《(Hummingbird in the Garden)》</span></p><span></span><p><span>8. 《Blossoms》</span></p><span></span><p><span>9. 《Your Melody》</span></p><span></span><p><span>10. 《Aphantasian Dreams》</span></p><span></span><p><span>11. 《The Fire》</span></p><span></span><p><span>12. 《Soak My Head》</span></p><span></span><p><span>13. 《When the Smoke Abates》</span></p><span></span><p><span>14. 《Another Quiet Sunday (Keep Moving On)》</span></p><span></span><p><span>15. 《On Your Own》</span></p><span></span><p><span>16. 《Too Much Tension》</span></p><span></span><p><span>17. 《Deeper Water》</span></p><span></span><p><span>18. 《Feel the Same》</span></p><span></span><p><span>19. 《Wash Over Me》</span></p>]]></description>
